{"availability":"available","full":"nezanuha/markdown-text-editor","name":"markdown-text-editor","description":"A markdown editor that enhances your textarea instead of replacing it, so form submission, validation and required fields keep working.","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":66,"forks":12,"created":"2025-01-15T07:08:25Z","updated":"2026-10-08T06:47:48Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://frutjam.com/plugins/markdown-editor","topics":["django","editor","javascript","laravel","markdown","markdown-editor","open-source","rails","real-time-preview","rich-text-editor","syntax-highlighting","textarea","typescript","wysiwyg","wysiwyg-editor"],"demo":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/markdown-text-editor","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.328Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.328Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.328Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.328Z","stars":66,"forks":12}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A lightweight, embeddable JavaScript Markdown editor that transforms a standard HTML into a full-featured editing experience — without breaking native form submission. Works with any backend (Django, Laravel, PHP, Node.js, Rails) out of the box.","A native-first Markdown editor built on a standard textarea. No data binding, no API — just drop it in and your forms keep working as-is.","Works standalone. No Frutjam, no Tailwind, no framework required, the styles are bundled."],"features":["🔌 Native Form Integration — Works exactly like a standard . No complex APIs — just use .value or the name attribute. Compatible with Django, Laravel, PHP, Rails, Node.js, and with React or Vue via a ref and destroy()…","🔀 WYSIWYG Hybrid Mode — Renders bold, italic, headings, and code live as you type while keeping the underlying Markdown. Switch to plain mode for raw syntax editing","⚡ Live Preview — Full side-by-side Markdown preview with clickable task list checkboxes that sync back to the source instantly","🔧 Bring Your Own Renderer — Swap marked for markdown-it or any other parser so the preview matches whatever your backend renders. The sanitizer is replaceable too, and DOMPurify still runs by default","🏷️ Variable Dropdown — Give template authors a menu of readable names that insert placeholders like {{customer.name}}. Entries can be grouped, and a sample value can stand in for the placeholder in the preview"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nezanuha/markdown-text-editor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"384256ae11504134416ffbaeaf02c69fcc9378b6bb3b224d39a2225354a5274e","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.473Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.473Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A lightweight, embeddable JavaScript Markdown editor that transforms a standard HTML into a full-featured editing experience — without breaking native form submission. Works with any backend (Django, Laravel, PHP, Node.js, Rails) out of the box.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nezanuha/markdown-text-editor/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"384256ae11504134416ffbaeaf02c69fcc9378b6bb3b224d39a2225354a5274e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nezanuha/markdown-text-editor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.473Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T06:47:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nezanuha/markdown-text-editor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.474Z","hash":"384256ae11504134416ffbaeaf02c69fcc9378b6bb3b224d39a2225354a5274e","originalBytes":12408,"storedBytes":12408,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["editor","value","markdown","markdowneditor","mode","preview","markdown-editor","toolbar","textarea","javascript","new","hybrid","const","live","own","form","onchange","via","works","wysiwyg","any","bold","event","exactly","just","native","npm","submit","support","text","tools